{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GABEN: Elevator Pitch Simulator</strong> is a clever comedy that throws ironic jabs at the modern gaming industry and pop culture clich\u00e9s. Come up with the most outlandish combinations of themes and genres to thaw Gaben's heart and release the game of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997380/extras/da1eaec7bb15f31d9cdde5e90b08094c.avif?t=1760273797\" width=1560 height=494 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A HIGHLY INTERACTIVE EXPERIENCE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a true game developer and create a game that's sure to take the world by storm (and impress Gaben!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your creative ideas against criticism,\u00a0fending off tricky questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal adventure, full of references to video games and pop culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple unique endings that will leave you asking for more (if you stay sane \ud83d\ude0e)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hilarious parody\u00a0with dozens of mind-blowing jokes and gags to suit every taste</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Everything is possible\u2026 until the elevator stops!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\ude0e FREE DEMO INCOMING THIS FALL</strong>\u00a0<strong>\ud83d\ude0e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997380/extras/b6b514204751276ca0480a7167367ad0.avif?t=1760273797\" width=1560 height=2340 />